<h2 local-id=3D"6981f5a0-7f0f-4657-8903-a2ffa8218b97" id=3D"TSD-ATSDataPart=
itioning-DeploymentPlan"><br>
Deployment Plan</h2>
<p local-id=3D"96840671-ed4a-4986-9eb3-5267c3896d66"><span style=3D"backgro=
und-color: rgb(220,223,228);">DownTime window 30 min. (Sometime in May Mont=
h)</span></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"1328fb2f-4c2a-4fe0-a709-1dac24ca92a2" id=3D"TSD-ATSDataPart=
itioning-UATSteps:">UAT Steps:</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"4a3ad9a2-376a-4560-b4ae-2a6efafd8dea">
<li local-id=3D"e881d59e-f4b7-4759-88d4-12e4b564c1cd">
<p local-id=3D"c7cd4119-64be-4f64-a3c9-fe17624c9ba2">Dev Team: Pause transa=
ctionIntermediate subscription &amp;&amp; transactionResponseTime subscript=
ion.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"947e6865-6755-42af-bb3b-3adc0776c9a8">
<p local-id=3D"7e8fa4e5-f5ed-4a5a-b1b3-1c0acf6a2c20">Dev Team: Stop ATS and=
 ATS-webhook services</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8618c4c1-f7a4-46ef-92a8-2043999cda72">
<p local-id=3D"e8b49cf9-874a-427a-90c3-62d9fb82f32e">DB Team: Validate repl=
ication lags and sync pending records , if lag is present (wait for it to h=
appen automatic or can be done manually as well).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d960f110-1a95-41e3-8f03-25308f6236e0">
<p local-id=3D"01d29101-198f-4a09-9454-f6626665b04b">DB Team: Updating old =
DB to only read <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://mode.No" rel=3D"n=
ofollow">mode.</a> (<strong>Enable: No Login Mode)</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4ffed421-7d12-45ea-8956-4aa54f7e7f42">
<p local-id=3D"f83b9121-a857-4be3-b6df-5934784eaf12">Dev Team: Update seque=
nces in new DB with values from Old DB, to start sequence value from where =
it was left in old DB.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3bc0b90d-be8f-4ed9-a5c0-33f8f77de651">
<p local-id=3D"bf36da7b-012a-4584-b435-8785efefe8d3">Dev Team: Update PG-De=
lta to connect to new DB</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"76af6630-0251-4224-bf43-8f52ec60894b">
<p local-id=3D"b4b6c5bc-d53d-463d-ab04-c8be182e29bf">Dev Team: Deploy Appli=
cations with new changes related to DB partitioning.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"da3af698-6e56-4cab-b174-41b1620856e8">
<p local-id=3D"b541b617-1f95-4246-9a51-8529e55d9388">Dev Team: Restart ATS =
and ATS-webhook services</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e3618c60-1713-4c03-9cdf-609475f8be0c">
<p local-id=3D"486d9299-a3d7-4ea8-a316-c2aa335e8a4f">Dev Team: Do sanity by=
 running release transaction api and sample transactions</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"ed6ce8f8-3e6f-47ca-b875-430d6b94e0f4"></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"0ba222b3-b828-44f6-8a67-3d0779bc81f3" id=3D"TSD-ATSDataPart=
itioning-ProdDeploymentSteps">Prod Deployment Steps</h4>
<h5 local-id=3D"cb071a31-aaf6-4a56-b018-66ae18a1a38b" id=3D"TSD-ATSDataPart=
itioning-DEV,SRE,DBandQATeam">DEV, SRE , DB and QA Team <a class=3D"conflue=
nce-userlink user-mention" data-account-id=3D"712020:079d96bf-1d77-4916-839=
2-afda2d17bf53" href=3D"https://zeta-tm.atlassian.net/wiki/people/712020:07=
9d96bf-1d77-4916-8392-afda2d17bf53?ref=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_blank" data=
-linked-resource-id=3D"2943419675" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-=
linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://zeta-tm.atlassia=
n.net/wiki">ANIL BANDI</a> <a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" da=
ta-account-id=3D"62d00d7dc4c3be001fb591f8" href=3D"https://zeta-tm.atlassia=
n.net/wiki/people/62d00d7dc4c3be001fb591f8?ref=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_bla=
nk" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2760999774" data-linked-resource-version=3D"=
1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://zeta-tm.=
atlassian.net/wiki">VINAYAK JAIN</a></h5>
<p local-id=3D"85c95b99-9e36-4634-88b9-8720b942f081"><strong>Down Time wind=
ow 30 min. (Q2 release)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ffc1bd7d-070c-4bcd-893e-949c8401afeb"><br><span style=3D"bac=
kground-color: rgb(220,223,228);">Note: SRE Team: During cutover any failur=
e, rollback to old DB and fallback to previous state</span><br><span style=
=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);">--------In first 10min--------</sp=
an></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d057d791-1258-4111-8a40-2922993d4ec6">
<li local-id=3D"23d07e98-5612-4c10-9988-d03811cad310">
<p local-id=3D"5fd2e4a7-238c-43f6-a8d0-cd30bff88606">SRE Team: Pause transa=
ctionIntermediate subscription &amp;&amp; transactionResponseTime subscript=
ion. (Through API/ atropos-operator)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"599bd891-ebb3-468b-a498-b005a0b21e86">
<p local-id=3D"5c245d3e-5eda-4845-8844-2d4084f390c6">SRE Team: Stop ATS and=
 ATS-webhook services</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dcb220b1-ff62-4ee9-9849-d9c8ea52f4cd">
<p local-id=3D"08d83708-d3cb-4ece-a433-e46d30d24820">SRE Team: Stop Transac=
tion release jobs as well.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9db6be4c-f404-4dc0-8501-6993e23059e0">
<p local-id=3D"ec58abc8-1189-424a-a5c0-c36f649c5bbb">DB Team: Validate repl=
ication lags and sync pending records , if lag is present (wait for it to h=
appen automatic or can be done manually as well).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a1fc9cfb-05d0-442a-9c14-bbb202aa3961">
<p local-id=3D"9719a37a-43cb-4ae7-9aa6-968609bc3167">DB Team: Updating old =
DB to only read mode.(<strong>Enable: No Login Mode)</strong><br>
Add dashboards for db logs, app logs=E2=80=A6 <a class=3D"confluence-userli=
nk user-mention" data-account-id=3D"712020:079d96bf-1d77-4916-8392-afda2d17=
bf53" href=3D"https://zeta-tm.atlassian.net/wiki/people/712020:079d96bf-1d7=
7-4916-8392-afda2d17bf53?ref=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_blank" data-linked-re=
source-id=3D"2943419675" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-res=
ource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://zeta-tm.atlassian.net/wiki=
">ANIL BANDI</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"26e60423-61d0-4d26-98ab-f4269187fbb7">
<p local-id=3D"e22ea909-e773-4e30-a892-9e375e930bbe">Dev Team: Update seque=
nces in new DB with values from Old DB, to start sequence value from where =
it was left in old DB.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd6fe7fd-6e30-423a-ad27-e3315d3f7f7c">
<p local-id=3D"b2b14855-acb5-45c3-98ad-97065a477eff">Dev Team: Update PG-De=
lta to connect to new DB</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"bfb7ed7a-4a1c-4063-9fcf-bbfa3849b962"><em><strong><span styl=
e=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);">In next 10 min, Once in above ste=
ps are completed and verified, then proceed with below steps</span></strong=
></em><br><br>
7. SRE Team: Deploy Applications with new changes related to DB partitionin=
g.<br>
8. SRE Team: Restart ATS-webhook</p>
<ol start=3D"9" local-id=3D"32151bb4-be79-4554-b62e-ea5b5a3eabb6">
<li local-id=3D"cab2d317-f701-46c6-94df-b353577be38b">
<p local-id=3D"e9fef27a-fd19-48b5-a602-1b8621c640b3">Dev Team: Do sanity by=
 running release transaction api</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"11d7eef9-6855-4710-9233-8b7668bb7aa7">
<p local-id=3D"e751a859-8c06-43f2-a81f-a85e822bf8b7">Dev Team: If above ste=
p is successful, then start ATS -&gt; Do sanity by running release transact=
ion api, do sanity test by triggering auth transactions.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6468d80-65de-46f3-9daf-dec7a085c7de">
<p local-id=3D"f2297527-6646-40ac-b088-be8557cc8a1d">Dev Team: If above ste=
p is successful, then start transactionIntermediate subscription &amp;&amp;=
 transactionResponseTime subscription. (Through API/ atropos-operator)</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"93785946-78fc-4225-bd33-cec5a428e64a">
<p local-id=3D"3883b981-7d6f-45ac-9e8a-dae06b47a9d7">SRE Team: Restart axon=
-morpheus and axon-fis-mq-connector services as well.<br><br><strong><span =
style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,253);">FailOver Steps</span></strong=
><br>
1. Enable Write access on old db<br>
2.Revert Delta changes<br>
3.Revert Axon-Transaction-Service <br>
4.Restart Axon-Transaction-Service and Axon-Transaction-Webhooks<br>
5. Enable Subscriptions</p></li>
</ol>
